    <Description URL="">Sanskrit ISO-15919 Phonetic (OPTITRANS) keyboard is ISO 15919 romanization input method by a modified version of OPTITRANS and Harvard-Kyoto transliteration systems. Type saMskRta for saṃskṛta.</Description>
